> The starting point for every other recipe: an espresso at a 1:2 ratio.

Finely grind @coffee beans{18%g} in the #grinder{}.

Extract @water{36%g} at 93 °C in the #espresso machine{} for ~{28%s}.

== Serving ==

Serve immediately in a #preheated cup{}.
